            "url": "http://store.steampowered.com/news/3514/",
            "content": " \nUpdates to Tank Universal have been released. The updates will be applied automatically when your Steam client is restarted. The major changes include:<br><ul style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" ><li>Windows7 compatibility <br><li>Animation enhancements for sapper and artillery units (extra track animations on these unit's tank bases)<br><li>Minor pathfinding tweaks (tanks are more responsive to AI commands)<br></ul>\t\t\t\t"
